---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy" description="Privacy information for the Tarian Ventures website, including implementation facts and information awaiting confirmation.">
  <PageIntro label="Legal information" title="Privacy"><p>Website and business enquiry privacy information.</p></PageIntro>
  <div class="shell legal-content">
    <aside class="review-notice" aria-label="Review status"><strong>Review draft — not a final privacy notice.</strong><p>Business processing details and deployed hosting behaviour still require confirmation before publication.</p></aside>
    <section><h2>Website implementation</h2><p>This website implementation contains no analytics, advertising, tracking pixels, contact forms, embedded content or remote API integrations. It does not set application cookies or use local or session storage. Fonts and visual assets do not load from third-party services.</p><p>These statements describe the website code. Hosting configuration, request logging and any provider-added behaviour must be checked on the deployed site.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Email enquiries</h2><p>The Contact page provides email links. Activating a link opens your chosen email application; the website itself does not submit a form. Any information you choose to send is handled through the business’s email arrangements.</p><p>The purposes and lawful basis for handling enquiries, email provider, recipients, international transfers and retention arrangements have not yet been confirmed for this notice.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Information awaiting confirmation</h2><ul><li>Verified controller identity, registered address and privacy contact.</li><li>Hosting provider configuration, request logs and processing arrangements.</li><li>Business enquiry processing, service providers and retention arrangements.</li><li>Applicable rights, how to exercise them and complaint information.</li></ul><p>These areas must be completed from verified business information. No processor list or retention period is assumed.</p></section>
    <p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Contact Tarian Ventures <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
  </div>
</Layout>
